<title>BELGIUM: EU clears German banks' ESG software venture.</title>
<headline>EU clears German banks' ESG software venture.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission cleared on Tuesday a proposal by Deutsche Bank and Dresdner Bank to establish joint control of ESG, a company offering software services for mortgage banking bodies, a statement said.</p>
<p>The Commission did not immediately give any further details.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800 (ATA/PIC)</p>
</text>
